<title>UK: Kredietbank unit sets 55 mln Ecu 8-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank unit sets 55 mln Ecu 8-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDIETBANK INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  KREDIETBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    55 MLN ECU    COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY    20.JAN.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.95    PAY DATE    20.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-5	 NEG PLG    NO</p>
<p> CRS DEFLT  NO	  MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST TWO YEARS, THEN 5.0 PCT TO YEAR FOUR,</p>
<p>		 THEN 6.75 PCT TO YEAR SIX THEN 9.0 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		 ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
